        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Gross functional strength preserved for light activities by patient report, with perceived reduced control and stability, especially overhead and with the arm abducted and externally rotated; feels “wobbly” with the arm outstretched."
      }
    },
