        "valueString": "Still working full time, self-modifying duties by avoiding heavy overhead lifting where possible and taking more breaks. Avoiding overhead plywood lifting, contact sport, and gym overhead press; activities of daily living are okay, but the patient is cautious with sport and heavy loads."
